  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0:\nNEW:\n• Works with Codabix v1.6.0 and higher.\n• Property \"NodeTypeId\" has been added to class CreateNodeCommand which allows to specify a NodeType to use when creating a node.\n• Class CreateNodeTypeNode has been added that allows to create nodes of class \"NodeType\".\n\nCHANGED:\n• BREAKING CHANGE: Node property \"Type\" has been renamed to \"Class\".\n• BREAKING CHANGE: Classes CodabixConvert, CodabixObjectExtensions, NumberExtensions were removed from the public API surface.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "title": "Codabix Industrial IoT via Web using SignalR",
